{"id":"b0bd67260e33f88d","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-low-simple.md","title":"低简单集合的存在","display":"thm-low-simple — 低简单集合的存在","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-low-simple","aliases":["20-thm-low-simple"],"display":"thm-low-simple — 低简单集合的存在","chapter":"7","section":"7.2","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 7.2.1；Lemmas 7.2.3–7.2.5","source_printed_pages":[149,150,151],"source_pdf_pages":[183,184,185],"depends_on":["[[20-df-simple]]","[[20-df-low-high]]","[[20-lem-stage-jump-limit]]","[[20-df-injury-elements]]","[[20-lem-use-preservation]]","[[20-df-stages]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-low-simple"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-low-simple</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-low-simple — 低简单集合的存在"},{"key":"chapter","html":"7"},{"key":"section","html":"7.2"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 7.2.1；Lemmas 7.2.3–7.2.5"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>149</span><span>150</span><span>151</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>183</span><span>184</span><span>185</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"428fc565e7338639\" href=\"?note=428fc565e7338639\" title=\"20-df-simple\">20-df-simple</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"91065cedbdf2fc27\" href=\"?note=91065cedbdf2fc27\" title=\"20-df-low-high\">20-df-low-high</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"476bf6706c15594f\" href=\"?note=476bf6706c15594f\" title=\"20-lem-stage-jump-limit\">20-lem-stage-jump-limit</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"18e11f4651f28406\" href=\"?note=18e11f4651f28406\" title=\"20-df-injury-elements\">20-df-injury-elements</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"fec296dc8eb84564\" href=\"?note=fec296dc8eb84564\" title=\"20-lem-use-preservation\">20-lem-use-preservation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>采用上游 c.e. 阶段枚举与半开 use。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"428fc565e7338639\" href=\"?note=428fc565e7338639\" title=\"20-df-simple\">20-df-simple</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"91065cedbdf2fc27\" href=\"?note=91065cedbdf2fc27\" title=\"20-df-low-high\">20-df-low-high</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"476bf6706c15594f\" href=\"?note=476bf6706c15594f\" title=\"20-lem-stage-jump-limit\">20-lem-stage-jump-limit</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"18e11f4651f28406\" href=\"?note=18e11f4651f28406\" title=\"20-df-injury-elements\">20-df-injury-elements</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"fec296dc8eb84564\" href=\"?note=fec296dc8eb84564\" title=\"20-lem-use-preservation\">20-lem-use-preservation</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}low\\text{-}simple}\\vdash\n\\exists A\\subseteq\\omega\\ [\\operatorname{Simple}(A)\\land\\operatorname{Low}_1(A)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}low\\text{-}simple}\\vdash\n\\exists A\\subseteq\\omega\\ [\\operatorname{Simple}(A)\\land\\operatorname{Low}_1(A)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_0=\\varnothing\">\\(A_0=\\varnothing\\)</span>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_i^s\">\\(a_i^s\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\setminus A_s\">\\(\\omega\\setminus A_s\\)</span> 中从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 起数的第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 个元素；若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_{e,s}^{A_s}(e)\">\\(\\Phi_{e,s}^{A_s}(e)\\)</span> 停止，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r(e,s)\">\\(r(e,s)\\)</span> 为其 use，否则为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>。阶段 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s+1\">\\(s+1\\)</span> 选最小 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\le s\">\\(i\\le s\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_{i,s}\\cap A_s=\\varnothing\">\\(W_{i,s}\\cap A_s=\\varnothing\\)</span> 且有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in W_{i,s}\">\\(x\\in W_{i,s}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x&gt;a_i^s\">\\(x&gt;a_i^s\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\ge r(e,s)\">\\(x\\ge r(e,s)\\)</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\le i\">\\(e\\le i\\)</span>。有则枚举最小这样的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>，无则不动。</p>\n<p>每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_i\">\\(P_i\\)</span> 最多枚举一个元素。负要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 的 use 和余集标记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_e^s\">\\(a_e^s\\)</span> 仅能被 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;e\">\\(i&lt;e\\)</span> 的行动破坏：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\ge e\">\\(i\\ge e\\)</span> 时，新元素位于其 use 之外，且大于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_i^s\\ge a_e^s\">\\(a_i^s\\ge a_e^s\\)</span>。因此各标记最终稳定，稳定值严格递增且永不进入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>，保证余无限。固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 最后一次损伤之后，若某阶段出现对角停止，该计算受到保护，此后停止与 use 不变；若始终不出现，则限制恒为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>。故各限制有有限极限，并满足上游跳跃极限判据，得到低性。</p>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_i\">\\(W_i\\)</span> 无限，等到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\le i\">\\(e\\le i\\)</span> 的限制与标记稳定、全部 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 的正行动结束之后，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_i\">\\(W_i\\)</span> 有足够大的元素满足选取条件；若此前未相交，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_i\">\\(P_i\\)</span> 必获得行动机会。所以每个无限 c.e. 集与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 相交，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 简单。原稿源页从印刷 148 起错移一页，现按实际定理及验证改为 149–151。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 7.2.1；Lemmas 7.2.3–7.2.5；印刷页 149, 150, 151；PDF 第 183, 184, 185 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-simple","status":"resolved","id":"428fc565e7338639","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-simple]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-low-high","status":"resolved","id":"91065cedbdf2fc27","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-low-high]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-lem-stage-jump-limit","status":"resolved","id":"476bf6706c15594f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-lem-stage-jump-limit]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-injury-elements","status":"resolved","id":"18e11f4651f28406","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-injury-elements]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-lem-use-preservation"