-injury-elements]]；see [[20-lem-use-preservation]]；see [[20-df-stages]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-stages","status":"resolved","id":"4ef1aee16db6b308","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-simple]]；see [[20-df-low-high]]；see [[20-lem-stage-jump-limit]]；see [[20-df-injury-elements]]；see [[20-lem-use-preservation]]；see [[20-df-stages]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}low\\text{-}simple}\\vdash\n\\exists A\\subseteq\\omega\\ [\\operatorname{Simple}(A)\\land\\operatorname{Low}_1(A)].","display":true},{"tex":"A_0=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"a_i^s","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega\\setminus A_s","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"i","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi_{e,s}^{A_s}(e)","display":false},{"tex":"r(e,s)","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"s+1","display":false},{"tex":"i\\le s","display":false},{"tex":"W_{i,s}\\cap A_s=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in W_{i,s}","display":false},{"tex":"x>a_i^s","display":false},{"tex":"x\\ge r(e,s)","display":false},{"tex":"e\\le i","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"P_i","display":false},{"tex":"e","display":false},{"tex":"a_e^s","display":false},{"tex":"i<e","display":false},{"tex":"i\\ge e","display":false},{"tex":"a_i^s\\ge a_e^s","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"e","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"W_i","display":false},{"tex":"e\\le i","display":false},{"tex":"j<i","display":false},{"tex":"W_i","display":false},{"tex":"P_i","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false}],"bytes":2466,"backlinks":[{"id":"6c6db5d136fdbfa2","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-low-simple]]；see [[20-df-redeg]]。"},{"id":"15cf85fd84eaf3f9","anchor":"ref-45","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"既有路线可继续阅读：动态枚举 [[20-thm-friedberg-dynamic-splitting]]；反演与精确对 [[2